      "independent_solution": "For each part start with a_1 and add the signed d four times; the requested first five terms include a_1. (a) 10,14,18,22,26, using d=4. (b) 29,24,19,14,9, using d=-5. (c) 1.7,1.5,1.3,1.1,0.9, using d=-0.2 exactly. (d) -3 1/2 means -7/2=-21/6. With d=5/6 the five terms in sixths are -21/6,-16/6,-11/6,-6/6,-1/6, equivalently -7/2,-8/3,-11/6,-1,-1/6. Each successive pair in part (d) differs by +5/6; the negative first term is not -5/2.",
