      "independent_solution": "From the arithmetic-progression recurrence, summing j-i successive increments yields x_j-x_i=(j-i)d for j>i, hence d=(x_j-x_i)/(j-i). (a) d=x_11-x_10. (b) d=(x_8-x_6)/2. (c) d=(x_23-x_20)/3. (d) d=(x_16-x_12)/4. The denominators are index gaps 1,2,3,4, not the number of terms including both endpoints. The subtraction direction is later minus earlier. Equivalent formulas obtained by negating both numerator and denominator are mathematically the same response.",
